	</div>
                <div class="postingContent">
                    <span id="lblSpecialRequirementText"><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong style="text-decoration-line: underline;"><span style="text-decoration-line: underline;">Simple Application Steps</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">If you are interested in this position, complete the following these simple steps:</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">1. Review the education and experience minimum qualifications (MQ’s) of the&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://www.calhr.ca.gov/state-hr-professionals/Pages/5729.aspx" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration-line: underline;">Research Data Specialist III</span></a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">. See the Minimum Requirements section above.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2. Complete the state application by clicking “Apply Now” above. See below for detailed application instructions.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">3. Submit your application package with all required documents - see the &quot;Required Application Package Documents&quot; section below.<br /><br />4. Once you have applied, take <span style="font-family: Arial;">the&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Exams/ExamBulletin.aspx?ExamControlId=2363" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration-line: underline;">Research Data Specialist III Exam</span></a>.</p><p><br /><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>**Education: If you are meeting minimum qualifications with education, you must include a copy of your diploma/degree and/or unofficial/informal transcripts for verification. Official transcripts may be required upon appointment.**<br /> </strong></span></p><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Applicants must also include a Supplemental Application (SA) for this recruitment. You must provide specific information in your response(s) which demonstrates how your knowledge, skills, and training meet the needs of this position. Responses must be no longer than one page, single spaced, formatted in 12-point Arial font, with one-inch margins, on top left include full name, Job Control #, and position applying for. Statements of Qualifications cannot be used as a substitute for the Supplemental Application.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Respond directly to the following Supplemental Application question(s):<br /><br /></span></strong><ol style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please describe your knowledge and experience working with SQL, SAS, Excel, and/or other analytics tools for healthcare-related data management projects and initiatives.</span></li></ol>
		<p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="2" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> Please describe your knowledge and experience with health care provider and beneficiary data, including license/certification information, eligibility, claims, encounter, capitation, utilization, pharmacy, vital statistics, and/or other healthcare data.</span></li></ol>
		<p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start="3" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<li style="font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> Describe one major project where you validated, identified, resolved, and monitored data quality issues.</span><strong style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span></strong></li></ol></div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong></strong></span> </p></span>
